    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The international conference on 'Quality in Education: Teaching and Leadership in Challenging Times' organised by Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED) concluded successfully at the Institute's Karimabad campus in Karachi. Three days of deliberations and discussions by national and international researchers, academics and educationists led to several outcomes including the identification of areas and issues for research and dissemination at future conferences.",
